  "description": "1. To convert the conservatory at the rear (left-hand-side half in plan) to a habitable room (kitchen/ dining), connecting with the existing rear extension (right-hand-side half in plan) and align the rear line with it.\n2. To convert the hip roof to gable roof, and add a dormer at the rear, and 3 additional skylights at the front.\n3. To add a vestibule door at the front.\n4. To add an upstand at the front and a fence between 13 & 15 St. Dunstans Avenue in the front garden, both under 1m high.\nAll external material to match existing; gable roof, dormer and skylights to be similar to the neighbour 15 St. Dunstans Avenue; vestibule to match the design & size with neighbour 1 St. Dunstans Avenue; upstand and fence at the front to match the neighbour 15 St. Dunstans Avenue. ",
